These patches modify PostgreSQL 18.6 for WASIX with the ictrobot_shm_v1
shared memory extension.

Copyright (c) 2026 Ethan Jones

The patches in this directory are licensed under the PostgreSQL License
(LICENSE), the licence of the software they modify.

Context lines are from upstream and remain the copyright of their authors
under upstream's terms.

0004-port-add-anonymous-shared-memory-for-WASIX.patch adds
src/backend/port/wasix_shmem.c, which adapts the skeleton of upstream's
sysv_shmem.c and win32_shmem.c: the interface scaffolding, the
shared-memory header setup and a few error messages. Those portions
remain copyright of the PostgreSQL Global Development Group and the
Regents of the University of California, under upstream's terms
(LICENSE-UPSTREAM); the rest of the file is licensed like the series.
